@30100 = ~Mage Armor~
@30101 = ~Mage Armor
(Conjuration)

Level: 1
Range: Personal
Duration: 8 hours
Casting Time: 1 round
Area of Effect: The caster
Saving Throw: None

By means of this spell, the wizard creates a magical field of force that sets the caster's base Armor Class to 6. This improves by 1 AC for every four levels of the caster, up to a minimum base Armor Class of 3 at 12th level. This armor does not hinder movement, adds no weight or encumbrance, nor does it prevent spellcasting. It lasts until successfully dispelled or until the duration runs out.~

@30110 = ~Burning Hands~
@30111 = ~Burning Hands
(Alteration)

Level: 1
Range: Special
Duration: Instant
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: Cone
Saving Throw: None

When the wizard casts this spell, a cone of searing flames shoots from the caster's fingertips towards a designated point. The caster's hands must be held so as to send forth a fan-like sheet of flames: the thumbs must touch each other and the fingers must be spread. The burning hands send out 10-foot-long jets of flame in a horizontal arc of about 60 degrees in front of the wizard. All creatures caught in the flames suffer 1d6 points of fire damage plus 1d6 for every other 2 levels of the caster, up to a maximum of 5d6.~

@30120 = ~True Strike~
@30121 = ~True Strike
(Divination)

Level: 1
Range: Personal
Duration: 3 rounds
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: The caster
Saving Throw: None

This spell grants the caster otherworldly sight, resulting in preternatural accuracy for a short period. While the spell is in effect, attack rolls are made with a +4 bonus to THAC0 and the chance to score critical hits is increased by 5%.~

@30130 = ~Shocking Grasp~
@30131 = ~Shocking Grasp
(Alteration)

Level: 1
Range: Personal
Duration: Special
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: 1 creature
Saving Throw: Special

When the wizard touches a creature while this spell is in effect, an electrical charge deals 1d6 points of damage and stuns the target for 1 round. If the target makes a successful Saving Throw vs. Spell, it is not stunned. For every two extra experience levels of the caster, the creature suffers an additional 1d6 points of damage and rolls its Saving Throw at an increased -1 penalty, to a maximum of 5d6 damage and a -4 Saving Throw penalty at 9th level. The spell expires once the caster makes a successful melee attack or after 1 turn has passed. The wizard gains a +4 bonus to hit the target.~

@30140 = ~Chill Touch~
@30141 = ~Chill Touch
(Necromancy)

Level: 1
Range: Personal
Duration: 1 turn
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: Special

When the caster completes this spell, a blue glow encompasses the caster's hand. This energy attacks the life force of any living creature upon which the wizard makes a successful melee attack. The touched creature suffers 1d6 points of cold damage and loses 1 point of Strength for 1 hour; a successful Saving Throw vs. Death negates the ability drain. The wizard gains a +4 bonus to hit the target, and the touch is considered to be of +1 enchantment to determine what it can hit.~

@30150 = ~Reflected Image~
@30151 = ~Reflected Image
(Illusion)

Level: 1
Range: Personal
Duration: 4 rounds + 1 round every 3 levels
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: The caster
Saving Throw: None

Upon casting this spell, the wizard creates one illusory image of the caster that travels alongside them. The image performs all of the actions that the wizard does and seems to react normally to both physical and magical damage, so enemies cannot tell which one is real. There is a 50% chance that an attacker will attack the image and a 50% chance that the attacker will attack the caster. The image is immune to all forms of damage, but disappears if Dispel Magic or Detect Illusion is used against it, or when the spell duration runs out. This spell cannot be cast on anyone who is under the effects of Mirror Image, and multiple castings do not create additional images.~

@30160 = ~Expeditious Retreat~
@30161 = ~Expeditious Retreat
(Alteration)

Level: 1
Range: Personal
Duration: 3 rounds
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: None

When cast, this spell provides all friendly creatures in the area with an amazing fleetness of foot. The affected creatures' movement rate is almost tripled for the duration of the spell, but the excessively unnatural speed prevents them from taking almost any other actions except for running.~

@30170 = ~Obscuring Mist~
@30171 = ~Obscuring Mist
(Conjuration)

Level: 1
Range: Long
Duration: 6 rounds
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: 20-ft. radius
Saving Throw: None

When this spell is cast, a misty bank of fog billows out from the designated point, obscuring all sight. Everyone within the cloud suffers a -2 penalty to attack rolls and has their line of sight halved. Anyone, inside or outside the cloud, trying to attack a creature concealed by the fog with ranged weapons does so with a -4 penalty to attack rolls. Creatures with blindsight, or that do not rely on sight, can fight within the cloud without penalties.~

@30180 = ~Dimension Jump~
@30181 = ~Dimension Jump
(Conjuration)

Level: 1
Range: Personal
Duration: Instant
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: The caster
Saving Throw: None

This spell transports the caster to any place within sight. When the spell is cast, a dimensional portal opens up in front of the caster, who immediately steps through. Upon passing through the portal, the caster arrives at the chosen destination. The caster always arrives at exactly the spot desired, and the dimensional door does not allow anyone or anything else to pass through. Spells about to be cast upon the wizard fail, and missiles about to hit the caster instead hit thin air.~


@30200 = ~Detect Alignment~
@30201 = ~Detect Alignment
(Divination)

Level: 1
Range: Personal
Duration: Instant
Casting Time: 2
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: None

This spell allows the wizard to search out the feelings of all creatures within the current area. When affected by this spell, a target will briefly glow red if evil, green if good, and white if neutral. Magic resistance does not affect this spell.~

@30210 = ~Battering Ram~
@30211 = ~Battering Ram
(Evocation)

Level: 2
Range: Medium
Duration: Instant
Casting Time: 2
Area of Effect: 1 creature or object
Saving Throw: Special

This spell creates a ram-like force that can strike with considerable power. The force can be used to open or smash locked, held, or wizard-locked doors, as well as locked boxes or chests, but it does not raise barred gates or similar impediments. If used against a creature, the target suffers 2d6 points of crushing damage and must save vs. Breath to avoid being knocked unconscious for 1 round.~

@30220 = ~Strength~
@30221 = ~Strength
(Alteration)

Level: 2
Range: Short
Duration: 1 turn/level
Casting Time: 2
Area of Effect: 1 creature
Saving Throw: None

Application of this spell sets the Strength of the character to 18 and then adds 50 exceptional Strength on top of this. The character receives any Strength bonuses appropriate. For example, if a character has between 18/50 and 18/00 Strength, then their Strength will be set to 18/00. If a character has a Strength between 18/01 and 18/50, then their Strength will become 18/50 plus the original percentage. If their Strength is less than 18, then it will become 18/50. However, this spell will actually lower a character's Strength if it is already 19 or more.~

@30230 = ~Ghoul Touch~
@30231 = ~Ghoul Touch
(Necromancy)

Level: 2
Range: Personal
Duration: 1 turn
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: Death partial

When the caster completes this spell, a red glow encompasses the caster's hand. On a successful touch, the spell inflicts 1d8 points of magic damage and paralyzes the target for 5 rounds unless a successful Saving Throw vs. Death at a -1 penalty is made. The wizard gains a +4 bonus to hit the target, and the touch is considered to be of +1 enchantment to determine what it can hit.~

@30240 = ~Power Word Sleep~
@30241 = ~Power Word Sleep
(Conjuration/Summoning)

Level: 2
Range: Long
Duration: 5 rounds
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: 1 creature
Saving Throw: Spell negates

When a wizard utters this power word, a comatose slumber comes upon one creature. Creatures with 20 or more Hit Points can save vs. Spell to avoid the effect, but creatures with 1 to 19 Hit Points are powerless to resist. Elves and half-elves are particularly resistant to sleep effects, while undead and certain other creatures such as dragons and elementals are completely immune to magically induced sleep.~

@30250 = ~Sound Burst~
@30251 = ~Sound Burst
(Evocation)

Level: 2
Range: Long
Duration: 1 turn
Casting Time: 2
Area of Effect: Target and enemies within 10 ft.
Saving Throw: Breath partial

This spell blasts an area with a tremendous cacophony. Enemies within the area suffer 4d4 points of crushing damage and are deafened for 1 turn. A successful Saving Throw vs. Breath at a -2 penalty halves the damage and negates the deafness. Deafened spellcasters have a 50% chance to miscast any spell. This deafness can be removed by Dispel Magic or Cure Disease.~

@30260 = ~Resist Elements~
@30261 = ~Resist Elements
(Abjuration)

Level: 2
Range: Touch
Duration: 1 turn + 1 round/level
Casting Time: 2
Area of Effect: 1 creature
Saving Throw: None

Upon casting this spell, the recipient's resistance to all forms of elemental damage is increased by 25%. This effect lasts for the duration of the spell or until dispelled. Multiple castings of this spell are not cumulative.~


@30300 = ~Clairvoyance~
@30301 = ~Clairvoyance
(Divination)

Level: 3
Range: Personal
Duration: 2 turns
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: The caster
Saving Throw: None

This spell grants the caster an unnatural perception of things to come. For the duration of the spell, the caster receives instantaneous warnings of impending danger and cannot be surprised or backstabbed. In addition, the caster gains a +2 bonus to Armor Class and a +2 bonus to Saving Throws vs. Breath. Clairvoyance cannot be dispelled.~

@30310 = ~Hold Person~
@30311 = ~Hold Person
(Enchantment/Charm)

Level: 3
Range: Long
Duration: 1 turn
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: Target and enemies within 5 ft.
Saving Throw: Spell negates

This spell holds one or more humans, demihumans, or humanoid creatures rigidly immobile and in place for 1 turn. The effect is centered on the target selected by the caster, and every enemy within 5 ft. is also affected. Those who make a successful Saving Throw vs. Spell at a -2 penalty are unaffected. Undead creatures cannot be held by this spell.

Held creatures cannot move or speak, but they remain aware of events around them and are helpless to change them. Being held does not stop any worsening of their condition due to wounds, disease, or poison.~

@30320 = ~Dire Charm~
@30321 = ~Dire Charm
(Enchantment/Charm)

Level: 3
Range: Long
Duration: 1 turn
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: 1 creature
Saving Throw: Spell negates

This spell functions in the same manner as Charm Person, but the target receives no bonus to the Saving Throw and the enchantment lasts longer. Dire Charm affects a single human, demihuman, or humanoid of man-size or smaller. If the target fails a Saving Throw vs. Spell, the creature regards the caster as a trusted friend and ally and will obey the caster's commands.

If the caster harms or attempts to harm the charmed creature by some overt action, or if the charm is successfully dispelled, the effect ends. If two or more charm effects affect the same creature at once, the most recent charm takes precedence.~

@30330 = ~Detect Illusion~
@30331 = ~Detect Illusion
(Divination)

Level: 3
Range: Long
Duration: Instant
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: 30-ft. radius
Saving Throw: None

When this spell is cast at a point designated by the wizard, all hostile illusionary protections of 4th level or lower within a 30-ft. radius are dispelled. This includes Reflected Image, Blur, Invisibility, Mirror Image, Ghost Armor, Invisibility Sphere, Improved Invisibility, and Non-Detection. Magic resistance does not affect this spell.~


@30400 = ~Confusion~
@30401 = ~Confusion
(Enchantment/Charm)

Level: 4
Range: Long
Duration: 5 rounds + 1 round every 6 levels
Casting Time: 4
Area of Effect: 30-ft. radius
Saving Throw: Spell negates

This spell causes confusion in one or more creatures within the area, creating indecision and the inability to take effective action. All hostile creatures within the area of effect must make a Saving Throw vs. Spell at a -2 penalty. Those who save are unaffected. Those who fail will either go berserk, stand confused, or wander about for the duration of the spell. A confused creature that is attacked perceives the attacker as an enemy and acts according to its nature.~

@30410 = ~Break Enchantment~
@30411 = ~Break Enchantment
(Abjuration)

Level: 4
Range: Short
Duration: Permanent
Casting Time: 4
Area of Effect: 1 creature
Saving Throw: None

Upon casting this spell, the wizard is able to free a creature from enchantments and curses. Break Enchantment can reverse the effects of confusion and feeblemindedness, free a victim from petrification, magical sleep, or charm, and break the effects of a curse. It does not remove a curse from a cursed shield, weapon, or suit of armor, but allows a creature afflicted by such an item to remove it. Certain special curses may require a particular caster level, ritual, or other means to counter.~

@30420 = ~Secret Word~
@30421 = ~Secret Word
(Abjuration)

Level: 4
Range: Long
Duration: Instant
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: 1 creature
Saving Throw: None

When a Secret Word is uttered, it dispels the magical protections affecting the target according to the normal Secret Word rules. The spell retains its existing protection-removal coverage, but is cast much more quickly and from greater range. Magic resistance does not affect this spell.~

@30430 = ~Farsight~
@30431 = ~Farsight
(Divination)

Level: 4
Range: Personal
Duration: 5 turns
Casting Time: 4
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: None

When Farsight is cast, the caster is able to view an area of an unexplored map. After casting the spell, select a section of the map to view. For the duration of the spell, the caster can observe that area and note creatures and fortifications within it.~

@30440 = ~Protection from Elemental Energy~
@30441 = ~Protection from Elemental Energy
(Abjuration)

Level: 4
Range: Touch
Duration: 1 turn/level
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: 1 creature
Saving Throw: None

When this spell is cast, the recipient receives complete protection from one type of elemental damage selected by the caster: acid, cold, fire, or lightning. The chosen damage type is resisted completely for the duration of the spell. Multiple castings are not cumulative, but a different element may be selected each time.~
